            "notes": "[Timelapse](item_20d43db5-d2ad-47e9-b32f-82d8eca006ce) is also a really good power, just free damage and free credits for aiming at a target, with [Foresight](item_f4163ce1-8f80-43ca-85d4-39812084400f) and her alreayd insane attack speed you really benefit from this power.\n\nI think [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) is also insanly good for tracer to keep her alive, currently we are trying to keep her surviability up while we still build creds, not much to it this round, stay alive and get creds.\n\nany extra cash goes into [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) and one instance of [Max Ammo](stat_max_ammo)",
