            "notes": "Alright in round 4 there still isnt much to it you have 2 optiosn from here.\n\nif [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) is doing gods work for you keep that and [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) and just invest all earnt cash into [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) and [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) aswell as one instance of [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) and [Max Ammo](stat_max_ammo).\n\nif [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) isnt doign much for you sell that and get [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) it gives health, cooldown reduction and passive regen, plus we need this power for later anyways.",
