            "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:33:20.270117+00:00",
            "notes": "ALRIGHT its round 5 and this is where the build peaks for the rest of the game, if you have the credits for the three purples we will get your all set.\n\nso the next power is [Quantum Clip](item_3a108115-ec6e-4b98-8074-1b015cf535f1), this gives us our one instance of [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) and [Max Ammo](stat_max_ammo) we have been getting.\n\nNow sell everything and get these 3 purples [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) and [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448).\n\nOkay let me explain these picks, now we have a constant 20% [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) on blink and recall. 30% once [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) is active. our blink should be now under a 3 second cooldown, this means every reload you blink, this activates [Quantum Clip](item_3a108115-ec6e-4b98-8074-1b015cf535f1) for every single clip of the game. since we use an ability under revery three seconds, [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) will also be active all round giving us a permant 15% extra [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) bascially a cheaper eye of the spider with extra effectiveness on its 10% cooldown. with the regen on [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) survivability of [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) and lifesteal from [Quantum Clip](item_3a108115-ec6e-4b98-8074-1b015cf535f1) plus constant blinks, you should be extremly hard to kill while also doing insane constant damage. you can now play your own game and self sustain with everything we have, no need to worry about healer anymore. you can now also take constant off angles and put on serious pressure  and 1v1 almost every hero, you can do whatever you want now, whethers that always being on the enemy supports, dps or anyone who is slightly away from therer team. literally do waht you want now, you have earnt it.\n\nps. any extra cash id try to get [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) for when vanadium isnt active, or just invest into [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power). try to stay away from too much [Max Ammo](stat_max_ammo) and [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) becvause it could mess up the flow of the build.",
