            "notes": "For powers this round it really doesnt matter what you get, honestly its what you prefer.\n\n[Auto Recall](item_ae3dbebf-c306-4408-b698-6f666ace0a7c) is good just as a failsafe if you are lacking, but honestly your recall should always be up with the 30% cooldown.\n\n[Get Stuffed!](item_3b0530be-462d-4e2d-8b4d-05c027d6aa60) is good just to get [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) up fast.\n\n[Alternate Ending](item_746b8915-22ff-4521-bc52-71b4edb630c6) is also good just to support your team however dont get this if your playing by yourself alot.\n\nfor stats try to get as much [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) you can while also compensating fro the enemy team, e.g. if they have a [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1) [El-Sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) is a greta pick or [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) against a [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49)",
